match: [Ll]azy
think 1
say Lazy-loading the product images.
tool Grep "<img" in src/
out Found 2 files
tool Read src/catalog/ProductCard.tsx
out Read 12 lines
tool Edit src/catalog/ProductCard.tsx
add <img src={product.image} loading="lazy" />
sh mkdir -p src/catalog && printf 'export const lazy = { loading: "lazy", decoding: "async" } as const;\n' > src/catalog/image.ts
tool Bash npm run build
think 900
